When an error is returned in streaming mode after some chunks have already been sent (line 241-244), returning here will leave the client with partial data and no final "done" message. Consider whether the client can handle this gracefully, or if error handling should be adjusted to always send a final error chunk in the streaming format before returning.
```suggestion
			if prompt.Stream {
				// In streaming mode, send a final error chunk before returning
